{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃーーーん！\nお誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/30/4456598/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん天然過ぎでね。\n一緒に喋っていると\n楽しくてしょうがないっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"BAD GIRLS J\"\n乃木坂46スペシャルナイト！！\nYouTube生中継"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに緊張すると思わなかったー\nガチガチでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/30/4456598/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まつ毛ガッッッ\nアイラインガッッッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/30/4456598/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部レザー。\nパンツ短いーーーうああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張してしかもヒールが高くて\n転けそうになりました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この衣装で挿入歌の\n世界で一番孤独なLover披露できて\nなんだか嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな衣装着たら\nかっこつけたくなっちゃうよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/30/4456598/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもばっぼいを意識した服で...\n一緒に楽しめてよかったです。\nいかつかったぜ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子も来てくれて\n嬉しかったなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナイツレディース3人組の\n真夏、寧々、万理華は\nいつになっても\nレディースらしくなれません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場に来てくださったみなさん、\n本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月9日が待ち遠しい！そわそわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！\n公式サイトで発表されました\n7thシングル表題曲のタイトル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『バレッタ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な曲です。だいすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのタイトルに7thについての\nヒントが隠されてるかもねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/30/4456598/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜はハーローウィン♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}